    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3561" root="بوق" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُوقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A shower, fall,</i> or <i>storm, of rain,</i> (JK, S,)
<i>that has burst forth with a dash:</i> (S, TA:) or
<i>such as is vehement;</i> or <i>disapproved, disliked,</i> or
<i>deemed evil:</i> (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُوَقٌ</span>. (JK, K.)

